      "widgets_values": [
        "ZT SLIDER — example workflow\n\nStage 1: closed-form solver; use its saved LoRA directly.\nBest starting concepts: simple attributes the model already knows, such as realistic/anime appearance, detail, colour or lighting. Complex concepts may not work.\n\nStage 2: OPTIONAL AND EXPERIMENTAL gradient training.\nThe lora -> warm_start wire is OPTIONAL. Connect it to start from solved weights; disconnect it to train from zero. plan, MODEL and CLIP are required if training. Improvement is not guaranteed.\n\nBefore running: select your actual model/encoder files and concept. Change output names if changing concept. Both stages are active here; mute the trainer and its report/loss displays for solver-only use.\n\nRuntime depends on your model, hardware and settings."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
