        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "READ THE REPORT AND COMPARE IMAGES\n\nimage_effect is denoiser alignment, not image quality. Check key binding, relative size and calibration status. Raw metrics precede final signed gain. Verification can fail while a solved file still saves.\n\nLOADING WEIGHT VARIES\nStart low and compare fixed seeds. Some of the author's sliders work around +2/-2; others need around +20/-20. Increase gradually; stop if only distortion grows. Higher weight does not fix a concept the solver cannot express.\n\nThe author's separate weight-baking tool is NOT included and may be published later.\n\nEXPERIMENTAL TRAINER\nWarm-start input is optional. Defaults: eta 2, learning rate 5e-5, 150 steps. These do not guarantee improvement. Compare solved and trained files separately using Load LoRA (Model Only). The trainer does not automatically verify its final file."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
